T*
(   3. The Brainwriting 6-3-5 Solution:) Tj
T*
(   - Structure: 6 participants, 3 ideas written on structured worksheets, 5 minutes per round.) Tj
T*
(   Sheets are rotated cyclically for 6 rounds.) Tj
T*
(   - Parallel Cognitive Throughput: All 6 participants write simultaneously, eliminating) Tj
T*
(   production blocking.) Tj
T*
(   - Anonymity & Equal Voice: Silent generation neutralizes verbal dominance, social hierarchy,) Tj
T*
(   and evaluation apprehension, producing 108 diverse ideas in 30 minutes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
