BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the SCAMPER creative ideation methodology. Apply all seven SCAMPER operators systematically to reimagine the traditional monolithic Relational Database Management System \(RDBMS\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Architecture of SCAMPER \(Bob Eberle\):) Tj
T*
(   - SCAMPER is a mnemonic prompt framework designed to spark lateral, non-obvious permutations of) Tj
T*
(   an existing product, service, or system.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Systematic Application to Monolithic RDBMS:) Tj
T*
(   - S - Substitute: Substitute physical spinning hard disks with byte-addressable Non-Volatile) Tj
T*
(   Memory \(NVMe / Optane\), and replace rigid table rows with flexible, schema-less JSON/BSON) Tj
T*
(   document structures.) Tj
T*
(   - C - Combine: Combine traditional transactional ACID properties with distributed horizontal) Tj
T*
(   consensus algorithms \(Raft/Paxos\) to create Globally Distributed NewSQL \(e.g., Google Spanner\).) Tj
T*
(   - A - Adapt: Adapt immutable append-only financial accounting ledgers to create distributed) Tj
T*
(   event-streaming platforms \(e.g., Apache Kafka\), treating state as a stream of changes.) Tj
T*
(   - M - Modify / Magnify / Minify: Magnify compute-storage separation: decouple storage into) Tj
T*
(   infinitely elastic cloud object tiers \(AWS S3\) while minifying compute nodes into ephemeral) Tj
T*
(   serverless execution engines \(e.g., Snowflake, AWS Aurora\).) Tj
T*
(   - P - Put to Another Use: Repurpose database transaction logs \(WAL\) as continuous real-time) Tj
T*
(   machine learning feature stores for predictive fraud detection models.) Tj
T*
(   - E - Eliminate: Eliminate complex relational multi-table JOINs, foreign keys, and synchronous) Tj
T*
(   distributed locks in favor of eventual consistency and distributed key-value stores \(e.g.,) Tj
T*
(   Amazon DynamoDB\).) Tj
T*
(   - R - Reverse / Rearrange: Reverse the query paradigm: instead of storing data and running) Tj
T*
(   queries over it, store queries and stream data through them \(Complex Event Processing / stream) Tj
T*
(   filtering\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 4:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the visual and neurological principles of 'Mind Mapping' formulated by Tony Buzan. How does radiating hierarchical structure mirror human cognitive associative networks?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Buzan's Mind Mapping Principles:) Tj
T*
(   - Central Focal Node: The map radiates outward from a prominent, multi-colored central image or) Tj
T*
(   concept representing the primary core theme.) Tj
T*
(   - Organic Curvilinear Branches: Major themes branch out from the center as thick, organic) Tj
T*
(   curved lines, thinning as they subdivide into granular sub-branches.) Tj
T*
(   - Single Keywords per Branch: Each branch holds a single keyword or compact icon, maximizing) Tj
T*
(   associative freedom and conceptual modularity.) Tj
T*
(   - Multi-Sensory Typography & Color Coding: Employing distinct colors for each branch sector,) Tj
T*
(   varied font scales, and pictorial symbols to stimulate visual memory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Neurological Congruence with Cognitive Associative Networks:) Tj
T*
ET

