(   - The human brain does not process information in linear, monochrome, left-to-right sentences.) Tj
T*
(   The cerebral neocortex operates via vast, radiating networks of interconnected neurons firing) Tj
T*
(   across synaptic webs \(Hebbian plasticity: 'neurons that fire together, wire together'\).) Tj
T*
(   - Linear text forces arbitrary sequential ordering, introducing high working memory friction.) Tj
T*
(   Radiant mind maps visually match the brain's internal semantic graphs, enabling instantaneous) Tj
T*
(   pattern recognition, cross-branch associative leaps, and superior mnemonic retention.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Application to Software Architecture Design:) Tj
T*
(   - Architects use mind mapping during early discovery to map domain complexity \(actors, data) Tj
T*
(   models, integration boundaries, security domains\) before freezing specifications into formal) Tj
T*
(   UML diagrams.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
