T*
(   Rollback carries zero data corruption risk.') Tj
T*
(   - Green Hat \(Creative Mitigations - 2 mins\): 'Can we roll back the core deployment, spin up a) Tj
T*
(   dark staging mirror with cloned live traffic, and test the hotfix safely?') Tj
T*
(   - Blue Hat \(Synthesis & Decision - 1 min\): 'Decision is clear: Immediate Rollback to protect) Tj
T*
(   data integrity. Team alpha validates hotfix in dark mirror. Re-evaluate at 15:00.') Tj
T*
