() Tj
T*
(   2. Three Rigorous Procedural Safeguards:) Tj
T*
(   - Safeguard 1: Blind Simultaneous Voting \(The Reveal Protocol\):) Tj
T*
(   * Participants write their assigned idea numbers on private index cards or digital sticky notes) Tj
T*
(   in complete secret. All votes are revealed simultaneously on a central board at a synchronized) Tj
T*
(   countdown, preventing observational influence.) Tj
T*
(   - Safeguard 2: Multi-Color Secret Tokens / Digital Anonymity:) Tj
T*
(   * Utilizing anonymous digital voting platforms \(e.g., Miro / Mentimeter\) where live dot counts) Tj
T*
(   are hidden from view until the voting window formally closes.) Tj
T*
(   - Safeguard 3: Split Categorical Voting:) Tj
T*
(   * Instead of generic voting dots, distribute specialized categorical dots to every participant:) Tj
T*
(   * 2 Blue Dots: Highest Technical Feasibility.) Tj
T*
(   * 2 Green Dots: Highest User Delight.) Tj
T*
(   * 1 Purple Dot: Wildest Long-Term Breakthrough Potential.) Tj
T*
