T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Cognitive Mechanics of Crazy Eights:) Tj
T*
(   - Perfectionism and analytical paralysis cause engineers and designers to fixate on fine-tuning) Tj
T*
(   their very first concept, polishing minor details while failing to explore radical alternative) Tj
T*
(   layouts.) Tj
T*
(   - Crazy Eights imposes extreme time pressure: 8 sketches in 8 minutes \(60 seconds per sketch\).) Tj
T*
(   This forces the brain to disengage perfectionist top-down filters, exhausting obvious visual) Tj
T*
(   patterns by sketch 3 and forcing novel associative improvisation in sketches 4 through 8.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Walkthrough: Mobile Crypto Wallet Transaction Screen:) Tj
T*
(   - Minute 1: The Standard Form: Traditional text boxes for recipient public key, amount, and a) Tj
T*
(   blue 'Send' button. \(Obvious baseline\).) Tj
T*
(   - Minute 2: QR Scanner Fullscreen: The camera is the entire screen; auto-detects QR codes) Tj
T*
(   instantly without typing.) Tj
T*
