T*
(   $50 to Alice'.) Tj
T*
(   - Minute 4: Physical NFC Tap: Bringing two smartphones physically together to execute) Tj
T*
(   transaction with zero clicks.) Tj
T*
(   - Minute 5: Sliding Velocity Dial: A rotary tactile dial where twisting sets the gas fee speed) Tj
T*
(   \(Slow/Cheap vs. Instant/Premium\).) Tj
T*
(   - Minute 6: Biometric Fingerprint Slide: A single physical thumb slide that signs and) Tj
T*
(   broadcasts the cryptographic transaction.) Tj
T*
(   - Minute 7: Voice Command Audio Waveform: Audio visualizer where speaking 'Send 0.5 ETH to Bob') Tj
T*
