(   3. Impact on Mass Adoption:) Tj
T*
(   - Office secretaries, accountants, and non-technical professionals required zero understanding) Tj
T*
(   of binary machine code or disk addressing; their existing spatial mental models of an office) Tj
T*
(   desk transferred seamlessly to the digital screen.) Tj
T*
(   - Commercialized by Apple Macintosh and Microsoft Windows, the desktop metaphor democratized) Tj
T*
(   personal computing for billions of humans worldwide.) Tj
