(   3. The Humane Engineering Paradigm:) Tj
T*
(   - Ethical ideation rejects dopamine exploitation in favor of 'Calm Technology' \(Mark Weiser\):) Tj
T*
(   * Time-Well-Spent Design: Delivering maximum utility with minimum necessary engagement.) Tj
T*
(   * Batch Notifications: Delivering summaries at designated hours rather than continuous) Tj
T*
(   interruptive buzzing.) Tj
T*
(   * Transparent Algorithmic Controls: Giving users full agency over chronological feeds and) Tj
T*
(   screen-time shutoffs.) Tj
